## Verification boundaries

- Prefer `node --check home-dark-cards/<file>.js` and `git diff --check` when
  available. There is no formal local test suite.
- The connected instance may have dashboard screenshot/browser automation disabled;
  when unavailable, verify source, resource registry, dashboard config, entity
  state, and service metadata directly.
- Before dashboard edits, consult the existing
  `.cursor/rules/home-assistant-best-practices.mdc` and its referenced guidance.
